  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "- Target the iOS 27 SDK (net10.0-ios27.0, Xcode 27).\n- Add navigation bar accessory.\n- Add ability to disable specific ItemViews of CollectionView.\n- Allow pining header of CollectionView.\n- Add justified text alignment to Label and TextView.\n- add min font size to Label and TextView.\n- Add text style customization for Spans.\n- Allow deconstruction of two-way bindings.\n- Rework app lifecycle and add one-time Start/Stop events\n- Allow implicit conversion for array list bindings.\n- Allow disabling layout pass when using View.Animate.\n- Make tint only source of truths for accent colors on views.\n- Add subtitle to menus in Button, Hold, Picker etc.\n- Allow minimizing navigation bar on iOS 27.\n- Introduce automatic/soft/hard scroll edge on iOS 27.\n- Add visibility priority for toolbar items on iOS 27.\n- Fix search and action bubble on iOS 27.\n- Allow custom sheet placement for modals on iOS 27.\n- Add grammar checking to TextField and TextEditor on iOS 27.\n- Move iPad only sidebar to new centralized unified one for iOS 27.",
